# U-Boot patch series for Apple Silicon, applied in this order with -p1.
#
# Taken verbatim from AsahiLinux/PKGBUILDs uboot-asahi at commit d0f67365
# (u-boot tag asahi-v2026.04-2); each file matches that PKGBUILD's sha256sums.
# Order is significant -- several of the uefi/efi_loader patches touch the
# same files and will not apply out of sequence.
#
# Roughly half of these are not Apple-related.  The asahi-alarm maintainers
# share one patch set across several Arch Linux ARM platforms, so the Rockchip,
# Raspberry Pi, Jetson and Allwinner patches come along for the ride.  They
# apply cleanly to the tree, and all but one hunk touch board and driver files
# that apple_m1_defconfig never compiles, so they are inert for our build.
#
# The exception is ARM-RPi5-Enable-PCIe.patch's hunk in drivers/nvme/nvme.c,
# which the Apple build does compile: it passes every DMA address through
# dev_phys_to_bus().  Apple's NVMe node has no dma-ranges, so that is the
# identity there, and Asahi's own U-Boot carries the same series; the
# behaviour is upstream's.
#
# They are kept anyway: applying the set verbatim is what upstream tests, and
# dropping entries risks context conflicts in the patches that follow.  Do not
# prune this list without rebuilding and diffing u-boot-nodtb.bin.
#
# Lines beginning with '#' and blank lines are ignored.

# --- generic boot behaviour ---
disable-VBE-by-default.patch
enable-bootmenu-by-default.patch

# --- UEFI / EFI loader: these DO affect the Apple build, all but the first ---
# --- (it edits config_distro_bootcmd.h, unused by the Apple build) ---
uefi-distro-load-FDT-from-any-partition-on-boot-device.patch
uefi-Add-all-options-for-EFI-System-Partitions.patch
0001-Revert-efi_loader-install-device-tree-on-configurati.patch
uefi-initial-find_fdt_location-for-finding-the-DT-on-disk.patch
uefi-enable-SetVariableRT-with-volotile-storage.patch
uefi-enable-https-boot-by-default.patch
efi_loader-disk-Add-EFI_PARTITION_INFO_PROTOCOL-support-for-MBR.patch

# --- USB Power Delivery ---
USB-PD-TCPM-improvements.patch

# --- other boards, kept for upstream parity; inert on apple_m1_defconfig ---
# --- but for the RPi5 PCIe patch's nvme.c hunk (see the top) ---
rockchip-Enable-preboot-start-for-pci-usb.patch
rockchip-rk3568-nanopi-r5-Drop-duplicated-extra-sdhc.patch
rockchip-rk356x-Stop-overriding-sdhci-mmc-aliases.patch
p3450-fix-board.patch
JetsonTX2-Fix-upstream-device-tree-naming.patch
Allwinner-fix-booting-on-a-number-of-devices.patch
ARM-RPi5-Enable-PCIe.patch
0001-Add-bcm2712-compat.patch
ARM-RPi-PCIe-fixes.patch
raspberrypi-Add-quirk-for-RPi5-2Gb-rev-1.0.patch

# --- host build fix, must be last ---
openssl-no-engine.patch
